# Provenance for every third-party tree vendored in this repository.
# Machine-readable on purpose: scripts/check_upstream_diff.sh reads it.
#
# Vendored rather than submoduled, deliberately: one clone gets you training,
# sim2sim and the robot. The cost is that "what did you change in their code?"
# is no longer a question GitHub answers for you — so each tree below pins the
# commit it was taken from, sits at the same paths it has upstream, and
# check_upstream_diff.sh answers the question in one command.

[deploy]
repo:    https://github.com/unitreerobotics/unitree_rl_mjlab
subdir:  deploy
path:    deploy/
license: Apache-2.0
commit:  UNRECORDED
note: |
  The G1 controller. Carved out of upstream's deploy/ tree and kept at the same
  relative paths. The copy predates this repository and its source commit was
  never noted; upstream was created 2026-01-27 and last pushed 2026-04-13, so
  it is from inside that window. Pin it before the first public tag by diffing
  deploy/include/isaaclab against upstream's tags.

